          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The secondary shortcut overlaps the primary or undo shortcut: one of them contains all the other’s keys, so pressing it would start plain dictation first. Translation is paused, and the secondary shortcut types what you say, until you choose one that doesn’t overlap." : {
      "localizations" : {
